     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_2" loext:marker-style-name="T9"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc172123637" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.2.<text:span text:style-name="T9"> </text:span>Do I have to create a new keystore for each app, or can I reuse the same keystore for several of my apps?<text:span text:style-name="T28"> 12</text:span></text:a></text:p>
